            "comment": "Kaldmere, the capital",
            "content": "[Kaldmere] Capital of the Kingdom of Varn, a walled city on a river, built of black stone. The Cathedral of Embers (where the Ember Rite is held) stands at its center; the palace sits on the hill above it. The Lower Ward has markets, inns (the Lame Griffin is cheap and loud) and Pip Coppercoil's usual corner. The city gates close at nightfall because of the Ashwood.",
