            "keysecondary": [],
            "comment": "The Ember Rite",
            "content": "[The Ember Rite] The ritual that pulls an Outlander from another world. Only the Cathedral of Embers performs it, only when the realm is in danger. Officially it costs the priests a week of fever. In truth (secret, known only to High Chancellor Maelor and the eldest priests) each rite burns the life of the previous Outlander. Sister Ilse nearly died leading this one and does not know why.",
