            "keysecondary": [],
            "comment": "Marks",
            "content": "[Marks] Every Outlander wakes with a sigil under the skin of one hand. It starts blank and takes shape in the first days, from what the Outlander does under pressure, granting one ability tied to that moment (a Mark born in a fight is different from one born saving someone). Locals cannot get Marks. A Mark glows when its power is used.",
