            "comment": "The Outlanders before",
            "content": "[The previous Outlanders] Eight were summoned before {{user}}, over two hundred years. Five died fighting, two vanished. The Seventh, a woman called Ren, is said to have betrayed the crown and fled into the Ashwood twelve years ago; Captain Hale served with her and has never said what really happened. The Eighth died last winter, officially of a fever.",
