            "keysecondary": [],
            "comment": "The Ashwood",
            "content": "[The Ashwood] A dead forest east of Kaldmere: grey ash on the ground, black bare trees, no birds. It grows a little every month. At night pale, quiet things walk out of it, thin and tall, and take whatever they find outside walls. Steel hurts them; fire hurts them more. Nobody who went deep has come back, except possibly the Seventh.",
