            "keysecondary": [],
            "comment": "Captain Hale and the guard",
            "content": "[Captain Roderick Hale] Commander of the palace guard, assigned as {{user}}'s escort. Served beside the Seventh Outlander and took the burn on his jaw the night she fled. Loyal to the king, not to the Chancellor. Respects courage and honesty; hates being lied to. His guards wear dented steel and red tabards.",
